{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "de",
  "language_raw": "German",
  "source": "message/dat/German/script/sdc01_0230.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/German/script/sdc01_0230.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_gfather_01",
      "hash64": "B61F513772593802",
      "text": "Wenn ich die wahre Geschichte erzählen soll,\\nwird das etwas dauern. Hast du jetzt Zeit dafür?[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_gfather_02",
      "hash64": "B61F50377259364F",
      "text": "Nun gut. Dann erzähle ich sie ein andermal,\\nwenn du bereit dafür bist.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_gfather_03",
      "hash64": "B61F4F377259349C",
      "text": "Diese Geschichte wurde in unserer Familie stets\\nmündlich weitergegeben. Ich selbst habe sie von\\r\\nmeinem Vater gehört.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_gfather_04",
      "hash64": "B61F4E37725932E9",
      "text": "Sie erzählt von der Wahrheit und darf auf keinen\\nFall mit anderen Dorfbewohnern geteilt werden.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_gfather_05",
      "hash64": "B61F4D3772593136",
      "text": "Ihr dürft sie also unter keinen Umständen\\nweitererzählen![VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_sister_01",
      "hash64": "58DB3930F6695A99",
      "text": "Öh... Okay.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_01",
      "hash64": "487E69A94330FA57",
      "text": "Vor langer Zeit verirrten sich ein Mann und ein\\nOni aus einem fremden Land nach Kitakami.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_02",
      "hash64": "487E6AA94330FC0A",
      "text": "Die Dorfbewohner fürchteten sich vor ihrem\\nErscheinungsbild, das anders war als ihres.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_03",
      "hash64": "487E6BA94330FDBD",
      "text": "Deshalb verboten sie den beiden Reisenden,\\nsich dem Dorf auch nur ansatzweise zu nähern.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_04",
      "hash64": "487E64A94330F1D8",
      "text": "Die Zurückweisung der Dorfbewohner schmerzte\\nden Mann und den Oni zutiefst...[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_05",
      "hash64": "487E65A94330F38B",
      "text": "Doch sie spendeten einander Trost und führten in\\neiner Berghöhle alsbald ein bescheidenes Leben.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_06",
      "hash64": "487E66A94330F53E",
      "text": "Ein einzelner Dorfbewohner empfand jedoch\\nMitleid mit ihnen... ein Maskenschnitzer.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_07",
      "hash64": "487E67A94330F6F1",
      "text": "Er fertigte mehrere Masken für den Mann und\\nden Oni an und schenkte sie ihnen.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_08",
      "hash64": "487E60A94330EB0C",
      "text": "Die prächtigen Masken waren mit glitzernden\\nEdelsteinen aus der Heimat des Mannes besetzt.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_09",
      "hash64": "487E61A94330ECBF",
      "text": "Mit den Masken konnten die zwei ihre Gesichter\\nverbergen und sich unter die Dörfler mischen.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_10",
      "hash64": "4881EEA94334122D",
      "text": "Der Mann und der Oni waren überglücklich und\\ndankten dem Maskenschnitzer für seine Güte.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_11",
      "hash64": "4881EDA94334107A",
      "text": "Mit von den Masken verdeckten Gesichtern\\nwagten sie sich schließlich auf das Dorffest.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_12",
      "hash64": "4881ECA943340EC7",
      "text": "Im Nu sprach jeder über die beiden rätselhaften\\nBesucher mit ihren herrlichen Masken.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_13",
      "hash64": "4881EBA943340D14",
      "text": "Ehe sie sich’s versahen, verbreiteten sich selbst\\nin fernen Landen Gerüchte über sie.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_14",
      "hash64": "4881EAA943340B61",
      "text": "Doch Geschichten über solche Kostbarkeiten\\nerwecken oft mehr als bloße Neugierde...[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_15",
      "hash64": "4881E9A9433409AE",
      "text": "Und so kam es, dass bald ein paar habsüchtige\\nPokémon nach Kitakami aufbrachen.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_16",
      "hash64": "4881E8A9433407FB",
      "text": "Sie schlichen sich in das Zuhause des Mannes\\nund des Oni ein...[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_17",
      "hash64": "4881E7A943340648",
      "text": "Dort versuchten sie, sich der sorgfältig\\nverwahrten Masken zu bemächtigen.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_18",
      "hash64": "4881E6A943340495",
      "text": "Der Mann, der zufällig zugegen war, vermochte\\neine der Masken zu beschützen.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_19",
      "hash64": "4881E5A9433402E2",
      "text": "Die übrigen drei Masken indes wurden trotz all\\nseiner Bemühungen von den Pokémon gestohlen.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_20",
      "hash64": "488554A94336F556",
      "text": "Einige Stunden später kehrte der Oni zur Höhle,\\nseinem sonst glücklichen Zuhause, zurück. Doch...[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_21",
      "hash64": "488555A94336F709",
      "text": "Er fand nur die Spuren eines Kampfes sowie\\ndie grüne Maske vor.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_22",
      "hash64": "488552A94336F1F0",
      "text": "Der Oni setzte die Maske auf und lief hinab ins\\nDorf, wohl in der Hoffnung, den Mann zu finden.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_23",
      "hash64": "488553A94336F3A3",
      "text": "Dort sah er die drei Pokémon, die sich mit den\\nherrlichen Masken brüsteten, und fiel über sie her.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_24",
      "hash64": "488558A94336FC22",
      "text": "Die anwesenden Dorfbewohner wussten nicht,\\nwas sich in der Höhle zugetragen hatte.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_25",
      "hash64": "488559A94336FDD5",
      "text": "Sie sahen bloß den herumwütenden Oni und\\nverspürten eine unbändige Angst vor ihm.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_26",
      "hash64": "488556A94336F8BC",
      "text": "In ihren Augen schienen die drei Pokémon das\\nDorf mit ihrem Leben zu beschützen.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_27",
      "hash64": "488557A94336FA6F",
      "text": "Aus Dankbarkeit nannten sie die Pokémon die\\n„drei Gefährten“ und betteten sie zur Ruhe.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_28",
      "hash64": "48855CA9433702EE",
      "text": "Der Oni zog sich unterdessen verwundet und voll\\ntiefer Trauer in seine nun einsame Höhle zurück.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_29",
      "hash64": "48855DA9433704A1",
      "text": "[EMPTY 35]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
